[[1,63,65792,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Drain the section of the pipe from the\nrecharging filler to the tank, following the procedure and the instructions\ngiven \n                                          <a href=\"#/2891490\">1043A02</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Place the car on a lift.</p><p><strong>- 4450B08 right rear wheel r r</strong>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2892269\">7055B43</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Using the tool (1a) inserted in the special openings, undo the\ncup (1b) from the LPG filler.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Spanner</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.794.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034361.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,65792,"<p>1. Undo the connector (1a) for the LPG filler (1b), then undo the\nnuts (1c) and remove the LPG filler.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034362.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,65792,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the LPG filler and secure it using\nthe nuts.</p><p>Connect the LPG pipe to the filler and\ntighten it to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Connection</p></td><td><p>PIPE FROM FILLER TO LPG TANK</p></td><td><p>1/4 GAS</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.6</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Using the special tool, tighten the LPG\nfiller cup.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Spanner</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.794.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2892269\">7055B43</a>\n                                           .</p><p><strong>- 4450B08 right rear wheel r r</strong>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2891491\">1043A04</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]